nts (2004) as an Audit trainee, Kaduna Polytechnic (2006 - 2007) as a graduate trainee, Cameo International Agency Limited (2007-2008) as Accountant and became a part of Mortgage Konsult Limited in 2008. He currently heads the Account and Cooperative unit of the Company<br></p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showName\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">Emmanuel Obaje Bsc, ACCA</div>\n                                <div mbr-text class=\"user_desk mbr-light mbr-fonts-style align-left\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".user_desk\">Head Accountant</div>\n                            </div>\n                                 <div class=\"user_image col-lg-4\">\n                                <div class=\"user_image_inner\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/mbr-500x333.webp\" alt>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            \n            \n            \n            \n             <div class=\"carousel-item\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 7\">\n                    <div class=\"user col-xl-8 col-lg-10\">\n                        <div class=\"row\">\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-8\">\n                                <div class=\"testimonials-quote align-left\">\n                                    <svg class=\"gradient-element\" viewBox=\"0 0 500 500\">\n                                        <g><g>\n                                            <path d=\"M164.45,219.27h-63.954c-7.614,0-14.087-2.664-19.417-7.994c-5.327-5.33-7.994-11.801-7.994-19.417v-9.132    c0-20.177,7.139-37.401,21.416-51.678c14.276-14.272,31.503-21.411,51.678-21.411h18.271c4.948,0,9.229-1.809,12.847-5.424    c3.616-3.617,5.424-7.898,5.424-12.847V54